py","eval":"GA 0.861 champ 0.550 BM 0.910 Smithy 0.890 Witch 0.750 bots 0.850","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T10:44:30","kind":"goal_best","iter":199,"check":{"score":0.8588,"n":400},"champion":"runs/c1/net_199.npy","eval":"GA 0.859 champ 0.530 BM 0.930 Smithy 0.840 Witch 0.760 bots 0.843","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T10:40:00","kind":"decision","title":"Card school for cards the champion never tried","text":"The card audit: Chapel never bought, Mine/Library/Moneylender bought in 4% of games, Council Room/Smithy/Village/Merchant 10-16%. In 15% of training games (stages 2-3) the learner's first buys are forced to 2 copies of one of 10 such cards, not recorded, so it learns to play them while buying stays its own choice.","rejected":"Recording the forced buys (wrong PPO ratios); a starting deck with the card (changes the rules)."},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:45:00","kind":"decision","title":"Curriculum ends against the champion","text":"Stage 1 rl-v1's own league (gate 84% vs GA), stage 2 + the frozen champion as 25% of games (gate 56% vs it), stage 3 open league with rl-v2 too. rl-v1 learned to beat az-v1 only once az-v1 was in its league.","rejected":"Self-play only; one flat league."},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:40:00","kind":"decision","title":"Start from rl-v1's checkpoint, widened with the helper inputs","text":"rl-v1 r2 was still improving when it stopped (67% to 81% vs GA over 2,200 iterations), and the helper inputs lifted rl-v2 by 3 points. Weights and Adam state loaded; new inputs at zero weight.","rejected":"From zero (rl-v2 plateaued at ~74%); imitation of the GA (rl-v1 already did that)."},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:34:49","kind":"stage_pass","stage":"champion","index":1,"iter":78,"why":"eval champion 0.583 >= 0.56","champion":"runs/c1/net_78.npy","eval":"GA 0.815 champ 0.583 BM 0.905 Smithy 0.875 Witch 0.750 bots 0.843","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:34:49","kind":"stage_start","stage":"open league","index":2,"iter":79,"expect":"Every earlier model, so beating the champion does not cost strength elsewhere.","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:30:00","kind":"decision","title":"No chain module in the player","text":"The released player is the network alone. On the chain exam rl-v1's champion picks the coin-best action 91.6% of the time, but with a turn planner (value judge or coins judge, K=32) or a chain rule choosing its actions it scored 48.8%, 48.5%, 48.2% (engine kingdoms) and 49.9% head to head against itself without it.","rejected":"A statistical turn planner at play time (no gain, 20x slower); a hand-written chain rule (changed 15 of 6,335 decisions)."},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:16:53","kind":"goal_best","iter":46,"check":{"score":0.8575,"n":400},"champion":"runs/c1/net_46.npy","eval":"GA 0.858 champ 0.465 BM 0.950 Smithy 0.870 Witch 0.775 bots 0.865","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:02:40","kind":"run_resume","iter":25,"stage":"champion","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T09:02:36","kind":"note","text":"Card school added to stages 2 and 3 (15% of games: first buys forced to an under-used card, not recorded). Restarted from the last checkpoint.","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T08:59:33","kind":"goal_best","iter":20,"check":{"score":0.8462,"n":400},"champion":"runs/c1/net_20.npy","eval":"GA 0.846 champ 0.517 BM 0.950 Smithy 0.840 Witch 0.760 bots 0.850","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T08:59:33","kind":"stage_pass","stage":"home league","index":0,"iter":20,"why":"eval GA base 0.846 >= 0.84","champion":"runs/c1/net_20.npy","eval":"GA 0.846 champ 0.517 BM 0.950 Smithy 0.840 Witch 0.760 bots 0.850","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T08:59:33","kind":"stage_start","stage":"champion","index":1,"iter":21,"expect":"A quarter of the games against rl-v1's frozen best net: finds and exploits its habits.","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T08:45:32","kind":"goal_best","iter":3,"check":{"score":0.8313,"n":400},"champion":"runs/c1/net_3.npy","eval":"GA 0.831 champ 0.477 BM 0.930 Smithy 0.855 Witch 0.760 bots 0.848","run":"c1"},{"t":"2026-11-19T08:44:49","kind":"goal_best","iter":2